{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32879","headline":"即席送许□之曹南省兄 · 李频","name":"即席送许□之曹南省兄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梅烂荷圆六月天，归帆高背虎丘烟。\n到时自见成行雁，别处休听满树蝉。\n卖劒爲赊吴市酒，携家犹借洞庭船。\n待看春榜来江外，名占蓬莱第几仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32879.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32879","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}